  "body": "https://notifications.spec.whatwg.org/#object-members\n\n> Call Object.freeze on action, to prevent accidental mutation by scripts. \n\nThis should not call the author-overrideable Object.freeze. Instead, call [SetIntegrityLevel](https://tc39.github.io/ecma262/#sec-setintegritylevel)(action, \"frozen\").\n",
